## 4. Validate and Commit

<%= it.variant({
  "claude-code": "Merge every worker's branch per `./developer-wave.md`'s `<integration-gate>`. Lint and typecheck, then re-run the affected tests, broadening to each touched package's suite. Commit — or fix mechanical errors inline, or send an implementation error back to the owning worker. Confirm every witness-matrix entry is pinned by a green in-suite control and every new mechanism carries its regression test and composed exercise — a matrix entry covered only by a manual run, or a mechanism without its test, is an implementation error; send it back.\n",
  codex: "Merge every worker's branch per `./developer-wave.md`'s `<integration-gate>`. Lint and typecheck, then re-run the affected tests, broadening to each touched package's suite. Commit — or fix mechanical errors inline, or send an implementation error back to the owning worker. Confirm every witness-matrix entry is pinned by a green in-suite control and every new mechanism carries its regression test and composed exercise — a matrix entry covered only by a manual run, or a mechanism without its test, is an implementation error; send it back.\n",
